      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FASCINATE GEORGE (2) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Finished third (22.66) at Gosford latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Form here at the trip sound including nine wins. Can find winning form. LIZZIE LONG LEGS (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with two wins and a placing from six tries. Below best last time at this track (30.47) in a Grade 5, finishing a 8 length eighth. Looks one of the chances. SEMI PEAKIN' (3) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 5th (25.41) at Maitland. Has a good record here at this journey. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from three attempts. Expected to feature in the finish. BELTONE BOY (6) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
